{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/vn/reviews/id492119939"}, "name":{"label":"Ito Oto Takumi"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2026-05-06T09:38:51-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"1"}, "im:version":{"label":"65.9"}, "id":{"label":"14035068661"}, "title":{"label":"Poor Customer Service"}, "content":{"label":"I arrived at the property with a confirmed reservation, but the hotel informed me they were overbooked and unable to provide accommodation. I was told that Booking.com had already been informed of this situation.\n\nI contacted your customer service multiple times, at my own expense, and was instructed to book another hotel while your team would arrange the cancellation and refund of the original reservation. However, despite repeated follow-ups, the issue remains unresolved.\n\nWhat is especially frustrating is that different agents continue asking whether I checked in, which clearly shows poor internal communication and case handling. I have had to repeatedly explain the same situation from the beginning each time I contact support.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/vn/review?id=367003839&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/vn/reviews/id341379451"}, "name":{"label":"Hana1910"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2026-05-04T05:57:18-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"1"}, "im:version":{"label":"65.8"}, "id":{"label":"14027290071"}, "title":{"label":"Không minh bạch"}, "content":{"label":"Tôi đặt phòng trên booking và đến khách sạn ở và đã thanh toán cho khách sạn đầy đủ nhưng booking là tự huỷ và thông báo no show làm tôi không nhận được tiền cashback. Tôi đã khiếu nại gửi mail cho booking khiếu nại liên tục nhưng không được phản hồi", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/vn/review?id=367003839&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
