{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/vn/reviews/id774656041"}, "name":{"label":"jerrynkl"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2026-05-03T02:12:29-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"65.8"}, "id":{"label":"14023089696"}, "title":{"label":"An Exceptional Stay in the Heart of Hanoi – Truly Memorable!"}, "content":{"label":"We had an absolutely wonderful one-week stay at The Chi Boutique Hotel and couldn’t be happier with our experience. The rooms were impeccably clean and well-maintained throughout our stay, making us feel comfortable and at home every single day.\n\nThe service was truly outstanding. The staff went above and beyond to ensure everything was perfect for our family. Their attention to detail and warm hospitality made a big difference.\n\nOne of the highlights was the breakfast: a great variety of both local Vietnamese dishes and Western options, thoughtfully rotated daily so it never felt repetitive, even during a longer stay.\n\nThe location is unbeatable, right in the heart of the Old Quarter. It’s just a short walk to Hoan Kiem Lake and St. Joseph’s Cathedral, one of the city’s most iconic landmarks, perfect for sightseeing and exploring Hanoi.\n\nWe truly appreciate the amazing experience the team provided and will definitely return on our future visits. Thank you once again to everyone at The Chi Boutique Hotel for making our stay in Hanoi so memorable! (Nguyễn Kinh Luân - Jerry Nguyen)", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/vn/review?id=367003839&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
